    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya geetiing'da humng'eeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ea nihita damanda jea goodiing'deawa NG'UTAMIIDA Eliya ghwaat humng'eeda aba shaarara, abeeda Eliya gwaleabu Gilgali sea Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Eliya ak gwayeesha Elisha, “Eaniyean apteada aba hiji, aba gideaba niijeaktanean NG'UTAMIIDA gaydawa ea dahita Beteli.” Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Adaghanyi gweanyi aniini maynung'sean heeda.” Hean geararang'aada eeweay Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu heeda Elisha sibanga bwatgeat abiita Beteli ak geeyeesha niny, “Ginali gideaba eanean NG'UTAMIIDA gaygageanda siidaang'u haw?” Gwayeesha, “Ea, ghaanali agooga asiinda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Eliya ak gwayeesha gicha, “Elisha, Eaniyean apteada aba hiji Elisha, aba gideaba niijeaktanean NG'UTAMIIDA gaydawa ea dahita Yeriko.” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA ea gidiibiideati ang'iing'i aniini maynung'sean heeda.” Hean geeweay Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu ghapka sibanga abiita Yeriko gwaneekiisa Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Ginali gideaba eanean NG'UTAMIIDA gaygageanda siidaang'u haw?” Gwayeesha, “Ea ghaanali agooga asiinda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Eliya gicha ak gwayeesha, “Eaniyean apteada aba hiji aba gideaba niijeaktanean NG'UTAMIIDA gaydawa ea dahita Yordani.” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA ea gidiibiideati ang'iing'i aniini maynung'sean heeda.” Hean ghang'eat gaweay duwaawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat siban haradam ea damanamughuush, ak ghwaat geeshteaba saawa ea ghwahita Yordani. Ng'ata ghamiinaada Eliya ea Elisha aba ghuuta eenda, ak eara sibangiga ghamiinaada nea neekeewa saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Eliya hang'daanyi ak gagilip ak ghwalasa badayda beega. Hean ghang'at bugusta beega, ak gagal suurja meatkweenagi nea gagal suurja meatkweeda niirja. Hean ghang'ata iyeenye nyaawa nea gwasik heeda ghajaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niighaaw ghwalamda Eliya ak gwayeesha Elisha, “Musa gidigasayi sean gaydasineey, heeda miyeegeandeawanean aba headaang'u.” Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Geamuscheey danyas guroorooda uurji nih itaang'uun nibiyeenya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Gimuschean ng'asheanda hang'waay, nea inyas gidaahaadanaan damanda sigeandeawanean aba headaang'u, gaynyasa. Nea iimidaahaan ea maynyasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani duu gaweay nea gabalooliin, hean ghwahidu aba geeshangiga mutukwajeanda mideawa beasta, ea faraasajeega mideawa beascheeka. Ak gooheeli fiisu asiyeenyean, ak gwadiyeada Eliya gawa humng'eeda nea ghwaat shaarara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Elisha ghwadaahaada ak gooyeawda aba badayda Eliya nea gwayi, “Bwaabwa, Bwaabwa, mutukwajeega fuga Israeli ea fuga ding'da faraasajeega!” Iidu ea mutghwadaah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoang'waay ak ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi ea ghoah nibiyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanu hang'dideanyi bea Eliya abisean, hean gabiikta ak ghamiinaada aba ghuuta eenda Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu hang'dida bea Eliya abisean, ak ghwalasa badayda beega nea gwayi, “Gwanda yeenu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Eliya?” Hean nea ghwalas badayda beega, ghang'at bugusta beega, ak gagal suurja meatkweenagi nea gagal suurja meatkweeda niirja, hean ghoaghaaw Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sibangiga bea Yerikohiin neekeewa ninyiin iidaah ng'asheesu, hean geeyi, “Guroorooda Eliya gwanda heeda Elisha.” Ak geapka eeroonyi Elisha nea geetkuy aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gealamda ak geeyeesha, “Ng'ula, gwanda hiji fugaagu bea gadiyeeda meanyi. Haradam ea damanamughuush, asi geemuscheey gaweay gagasa siidaang'u haw, gwadeepa ea nigeanu Guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwajaksa uhuumba giija, ghana jeemba moangoachi.” Ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha, “Adoocheakti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geetiktik muuchi ea ghabwaspwas ak gwayeesha, “Asaha oocheakta.” Hean geecheakta fih haradam ea damanamughuush ak geegasa eawooji samwagu ak ea meanyasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geebiikta heeda Elisha nea abeeda niny ghoamuughu saawa aba Yeriko, ak gwayeesha, “Heapi, meayeeshiineegwa adooweayi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega deamdeameadi bea Elisha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda fuga mujiini ak geeyeesha Elisha, “Ng'ula mujiineani leangaaschi aamiy muuchi, gawuurji gidanyaashta siideanyu haw. Ak beagaaschi ea munyas nea eara ng'eanyiida ea maygwaji gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Ayeanean gweeriideesh, nea ghoayiinyi jeeda balang'da.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa ea ghwahita gheang'deenda, gwajaksa balang'dida jeedida ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, naanung' gamiyeasiidi beesu, asi maygudugwanda miyeeda nea maygudugwanda hoosnooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gamiyeasiidi beegiga ea ghoah ghamneawa. Gawuurji gidanyaashta Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eada hoowa Elisha ak gawa Beteli, nea aba damandida mideewa naweedean, ghapka gheareemanga leabu mujiini ak geegaja nea geeyeesha, “Una humng'eeda gidameara! Una humng'eeda gidameara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goong'weersa bwadaw ak ghwadaah, ak ghamwaashta aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA. Hean ghapka aba geeshangiga idarooji iyeenya leabu dareabeeta ak gakuri gheareeman haradam ea iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'eada hoowa ak gawa giijeeda Garmeli, iidu gabiikna hoowa ak gawa ea ghwahita Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
